OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunshine, particularly towards
OL,7,FDown and Antrim. Mainly dry with just
OL,8,Fthe odd passing shower. A very warm to
OL,9,Fhot day.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with just the
OL,13,Fsmall chance of the odd passing
OL,14,Fshower. Some clear spells in the east,
OL,15,Fgenerally cloudier in the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
