OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAnother hot day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some sunshine.
OL,7,FMostly dry but with a few sharp
OL,8,Fshowers possible at times,
OL,9,Fparticularly in the afternoon and
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCooler
OL,13,Fand cloudier on Friday and Saturday,
OL,14,Fsunny intervals and a few showers.
OL,15,FCloud and rain likely to spread east
OL,16,Fon Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
